# Classroom mode control

- Student tablet UI modes (energy / peer / wish / sort / poster) are switched only by the teacher board toggles (WebSocket / session modes).
- Do not add student-side「返回」、入口按钮、或本地切换去离开教师开启的模式。
- When the teacher turns a mode off, the student returns to the default energy page automatically.
